Here's the problem file for turning off the television:

```pddl
(define (problem turn_off_tv_problem)
  (:domain robot1)
  (:objects
    robot1 - robot
    Television - object
    SideTable - object
  )
  (:init
    (at robot1 SideTable)
    (at-location Television SideTable)
    (not (inaction robot1))
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (switch-off robot1 Television)
    )
  )
)
```

Problem file generation is done.